    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389-a6">

                <pb facs="0698" n="628" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg628"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of request for arrest of mate and crew of the
                        Adriana.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >District Court of Lower California</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">La Paz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1883-02-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 2, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I will thank you to have the proper orders issued for the arrest and confinement
                    to the city jail of the mate and crew of the American schooner Adriana, at
                    present to be found on board of said vessel, and have them at the disposal of
                    this court.</p>
                <closer><signed>F. ENCINAS</signed>. [<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >seal.</hi>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
